00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.810
And I'll start with mine first is whereas childhood cancer remains one of

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:47.650
the leading causes of disease-related death among children in the United

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:52.500
States and whereas children diagnosed with cancer demonstrate extraordinary

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.170
courage, resilience, and determination as they face treatment,

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.980
recovery, and many challenges associated with their illnesses,

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.930
whereas the families of the children with cancer often experience significant

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.530
and emotional, physical, and financial challenges.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:09.630
And whereas health care professionals, researchers,

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:13.720
caregivers, volunteers, and charitable organizations work tirelessly to

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:18.310
improve outcomes, advance research, and provide hope and support to children

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:22.880
and families affected by cancer, and whereas increasing awareness of childhood

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:26.380
cancer encourages early detection, supports research efforts,

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:30.550
promotes community involvement, honors childhood cancer survivors,

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:34.450
and remembers those whose lives have been lost by this devastating disease.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.730
Whereas Patricia Haley Charity Inc.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:42.310
serves children and families impacted by childhood cancer by providing assistance,

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.200
encouragement, educational support, resources,

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:49.220
and programs designed to help families navigate difficult times.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:53.430
And whereas the city of Huntsville recognizes the strength and bravery of

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.580
children battling cancer, honors survivors and remembers those who we,

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.950
who we have lost and recognizes the dedication of healthcare professionals,

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.030
caregivers, charitable organizations.

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:07.550
And community advocates who support these families.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.380
Now, therefore, I, Tommy Battle, mayor of the city of Huntsville,

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:14.820
do hereby proclaim the month of September is Childhood Cancer Awareness

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:19.820
Month, and I present this to you saying thank you so much for all the efforts

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:20.590
