00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.590
Whereas the city council and the mayor of the city of Huntsville,

00:12:56.640 --> 00:13:00.070
Alabama wish to recognize Saint Jude Clinic at Huntsville Hospital for Women

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:03.580
and Children during Childhood Cancer Awareness Month for their dedication

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:08.260
to ensuring children in Alabama have access to Saint Jude resources without

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:13.270
leaving the comfort of their homes, whereas founded in 1962 in Memphis,

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:17.070
Tennessee by Danny Thomas, Saint Jude Research Hospital began its mission

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.500
to care for children affected by fatal diseases,

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.590
particularly cancer and leukemia.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:25.570
Whereas 4 years after Saint Jude opens its doors,

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:30.120
a significant milestone was reached, its first group of patients demonstrated

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:35.130
sustained cancer remission, marking the first cases of acute lymphoblastic

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:38.210
leukemia to be successfully taken off treatment.

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.860
And whereas since its opening, Saint Jude Research Hospital has become a

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:47.400
global leader in pediatric cancer, reporting an astounding 94% survival

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:52.160
rate for patients with ALL using therapy that does not expose patients to

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:56.360
toxins and radiation, whereas over 64 years of operation,

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:00.280
Saint Jude has helped push the childhood cancer survival rate in the United

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:05.990
States from 20% in 1962 to more than 80% today.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:11.040
Whereas in 2007 Saint Jude opened a clinic in Huntsville in collaboration

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:14.680
with Huntsville Hospital Health Systems that cares for children with cancer

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:19.040
and blood disorders, serving as one of eight Saint Jude affiliate clinics

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.630
in the United States, whereas through the diligent work of the clinic,

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:28.030
children in Alabama who are affected by cancer and blood disorders can receive

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:31.120
quality care close to home, now they're.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:35.040
Or be it resolved that the city council and the mayor of the city of Huntsville,

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:39.340
Alabama do hereby commend the Saint Jude Clinic at Huntsville Hospital for

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:43.410
Women and Children for furthering the mission of Saint Jude Research Hospital,

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.440
ensuring local children have full access to successful cancer and blood

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:53.680
disease treatment, bringing researchers one step closer to finding a permanent

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.000
cure for childhood cancer.

