00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:05.650
whereas for over 70 years Constitution Week has been nationally recognized

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.210
to remember the meaning of the United States Constitution.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:13.160
America's most important document, which stands as a testament of the diligence

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.160
of Americans to maintain their liberties,

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:20.510
freedoms and rights, and whereas in 1955 the National Society of Daughters

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.000
of the American Revolution petitioned the United States Congress to annually

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:28.510
set aside September 17 to 1923 to be observed as Constitution Week,

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:31.120
whereas throughout Constitution Week, the.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:35.210
National Society of Daughters of the American Revolution has striven to

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:39.450
reinforce the responsibility of Americans to protect and defend the Constitution

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:44.020
and emphasize that the Constitution is the basic basis for America's heritage,

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:47.710
whereas Constitution Week provides Americans with opportunities to learn

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:51.520
more about this significant document and celebrate the freedoms it grants,

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:53.770
whereas it formally to formally.

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:57.310
Commemorate the signing of the United States Constitution,

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.770
the National Society of the Daughters of the American Revolution encourages

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.810
every chapter to host Bells Across America,

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:07.020
a celebration where participants gathered to ring bells,

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:11.180
much like the church bells rang across Philadelphia when the Constitution

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.100
was first signed at 4 p.m.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.420
on September 17, 1787.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.120
Turn the page there we go.

