So what would we capture of that tax base?

00:46:39.370 --> 00:46:43.160
It'd be 54 mills total, 35 mils of the city of Huntsville,

00:46:43.450 --> 00:46:49.040
only 5.5 mils of the education portion, 13.5 mils of Limestone County portion

