of the overall millage.

00:46:50.560 --> 00:46:53.440
The overall millage of this area for, uh,

00:46:53.600 --> 00:46:55.750
Huntsville is 60.5 mils.

00:46:56.510 --> 00:47:00.150
So there'd be 6.5 mil that would not be captured in this uft district.

00:47:01.080 --> 00:47:05.820
Upon the creation of TIFF District 8, the full implementation of the proposed

00:47:05.820 --> 00:47:10.900
public investments, we certainly anticipate that it would yield significant

00:47:10.900 --> 00:47:12.730
new private investment in these areas.

00:47:12.750 --> 00:47:15.460
If, if I go back to this map, if you, if you look,

