01:23:28.010 --> 01:23:31.490
I am aware of is between $100,000 and $150,000.

01:23:32.070 --> 01:23:37.000
That benefit to the city is small and yet as Susan so eloquent Quintly put,

01:23:37.190 --> 01:23:38.810
is great to the individuals.

01:23:38.990 --> 01:23:43.620
And so I would advocate that we, uh, take away this tax so that it does

01:23:43.620 --> 01:23:46.590
not impact people who are, in addition to paying for these hearing aids,

01:23:46.750 --> 01:23:49.060
paying for the batteries, paying for the procedures,

01:23:49.230 --> 01:23:52.000
paying for the continued upkeep, uh, you know,

01:23:52.190 --> 01:23:55.140
as was once again said so well by Susan, uh,

01:23:55.430 --> 01:23:58.700
these are things that really do add up for the people of Huntsville.

01:23:58.990 --> 01:23:59.610
Thank you.

