01:33:59.890 --> 01:34:02.720
certain people are going to paint me as being difficult.

01:34:03.010 --> 01:34:06.640
They're going to classify me or call me a bomb thrower,

01:34:07.170 --> 01:34:15.460
but after much prayer, I think it's important to Hold this council.

01:34:16.420 --> 01:34:20.130
To following the rules that we are supposed to be operating under.

01:34:21.320 --> 01:34:25.910
A special session of the council was called by President Robinson for September

01:34:25.910 --> 01:34:26.740
18th.

01:34:27.510 --> 01:34:31.860
And it was published on the council agenda page of the city of Huntsville's

01:34:31.860 --> 01:34:38.300
website for a presentation of the FY 27 annual budget by the administration.

01:34:39.290 --> 01:34:43.990
I was prepared to hear that presentation and at that time offer any amendments

01:34:44.090 --> 01:34:46.360
I or my colleagues might have.

01:34:47.430 --> 01:34:51.580
However, I was informed by President Robinson in an email to the entire

01:34:51.580 --> 01:34:57.220
council that after meeting with the administration to review the reorganization

01:34:57.220 --> 01:35:02.900
chart and the fire and police pay raise, she believed it would not be appropriate

01:35:02.900 --> 01:35:08.580
to hold a special session to review the budget and other matters.

01:35:09.610 --> 01:35:15.310
And as a result, the council would hold a work session on September 18th

01:35:15.480 --> 01:35:21.120
to provide an opportunity to review the budget and the impact of the reorganization

01:35:21.290 --> 01:35:23.360
and raises on the budget.

01:35:23.970 --> 01:35:28.080
She mentioned later in that email that she did not think we would rush through

01:35:28.080 --> 01:35:33.440
action or should rush through action on the budget or the new staff structure.

01:35:34.500 --> 01:35:39.810
This explanation left me not being able to understand the full extent of

01:35:39.810 --> 01:35:42.830
what was to be presented at this work session.

01:35:42.940 --> 01:35:47.810
She had evidently just decided to switch from a special session.

01:35:50.210 --> 01:35:52.800
What the Indeed, what the?

01:35:54.410 --> 01:35:59.480
This was not according to state law in Alabama.

01:36:01.810 --> 01:36:06.920
There was no mention in the email I received concerning that this council

01:36:06.920 --> 01:36:11.160
needed to make sure that we were fully transparent with the public and the

01:36:11.160 --> 01:36:14.400
need for a careful review of public transparency.

01:36:15.880 --> 01:36:21.710
I believe All my constituents know that I am certainly an advocate for transparency

01:36:21.710 --> 01:36:27.750
for public matters, all public matters, as well as anyone who knows me is

01:36:27.750 --> 01:36:32.710
well aware that I play by the rules and I insist that others play by the

01:36:32.710 --> 01:36:33.200
rules.

01:36:34.020 --> 01:36:39.480
Perhaps transparency that she has talked about should begin with this council,

01:36:39.820 --> 01:36:46.170
or at least myself because I cannot speak for my other colleagues here because

01:36:46.170 --> 01:36:50.250
I'm not privy to what conversations they had with the president.

01:36:51.140 --> 01:36:54.820
From my understanding of the proper rules for conducting business and the

01:36:54.820 --> 01:36:59.810
Alabama law, I do not believe the president of the council has the authority

01:36:59.810 --> 01:37:04.760
to arbitrarily change a called and published special session of the council

01:37:04.980 --> 01:37:10.490
to a work session with absolutely no input from council members and as far

01:37:10.490 --> 01:37:14.770
as I am aware and certainly not the opportunity to vote on the matter.

01:37:15.650 --> 01:37:19.760
If this was done from some sense of personal power or authority,

01:37:19.970 --> 01:37:24.040
I wish, which I don't believe a council president has,

01:37:24.370 --> 01:37:28.400
and without following the rules or caring about my rights or the rights

01:37:28.400 --> 01:37:33.080
of other council members, it is a despicable action that must be called

01:37:33.080 --> 01:37:33.520
out.

01:37:37.810 --> 01:37:42.160
As a result, I am formally requesting that the city's legal department issue

01:37:42.160 --> 01:37:46.520
a written legal opinion regarding whether the council president possesses

01:37:46.520 --> 01:37:53.840
the unilateral authority under Alabama Code Section 11-43-50 and the Huntsville

01:37:53.840 --> 01:37:58.960
City council rules to change a properly called and published special session

01:37:59.170 --> 01:38:04.360
into a non-voting work session over the formal objection of a council member.

01:38:04.940 --> 01:38:09.770
And whether doing so complies with the public notice requirements of the

01:38:09.770 --> 01:38:15.370
Alabama Open Meetings Act, and I'd like that by close of business on September

01:38:15.370 --> 01:38:16.410
17th.

01:38:16.820 --> 01:38:20.180
And while I know it cannot be had by next week,

01:38:20.420 --> 01:38:25.730
I would also request an inquiry of the Attorney General's opinion on this

01:38:25.730 --> 01:38:26.130
matter.

01:38:30.100 --> 01:38:30.550
Thank you.

01:38:32.380 --> 01:38:32.540
Mr.

01:38:32.700 --> 01:38:35.340
Riley, uh, will you please comply with that?

01:38:35.910 --> 01:38:37.020
You, you will comply with that.

01:38:38.070 --> 01:38:38.550
Thank you, sir.

01:38:38.590 --> 01:38:41.000
By, and we can have that by September 17th.

01:38:42.380 --> 01:38:42.890
Thank you, sir.

